<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #333;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 20px;
    }
    .header {
      background-color: #f8f9fa;
      padding: 20px;
      border-radius: 5px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .content {
      background-color: #ffffff;
      padding: 20px;
      border: 1px solid #dee2e6;
      border-radius: 5px;
    }
    .footer {
      margin-top: 20px;
      padding-top: 20px;
      border-top: 1px solid #dee2e6;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #6c757d;
    }
    .inspection-details {
      background-color: #f8f9fa;
      padding: 15px;
      border-radius: 5px;
      margin: 15px 0;
    }
    .inspection-details h3 {
      margin-top: 0;
      color: #495057;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="header">
    <h1><%= @company_name %></h1>
    <p>Inspection Report</p>
  </div>

  <div class="content">
    <% if @custom_body.present? %>
      <%= @custom_body.html_safe %>
    <% else %>
      <p>Dear <%= @customer.name %>,</p>

      <p>Please find attached a copy of the inspection report for <strong><%= @property.property_name %></strong>.</p>
      
      <p>This report contains the complete inspection documentation including all findings and any deficiencies identified during the inspection process.</p>

      <div class="inspection-details">
        <h3>Inspection Details</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Property:</strong> <%= @property.property_name %></li>
          <li><strong>Address:</strong> <%= @property.address %></li>
          <li><strong>Inspection Date:</strong> <%= @inspection.date.strftime('%B %d, %Y') %></li>
          <li><strong>Inspector:</strong> <%= @inspector.name %></li>
          <li><strong>Form Template:</strong> <%= @inspection.form_template.name %></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <p>The attached PDF contains the complete inspection report with all findings and recommendations. Please review the document carefully and contact us if you have any questions.</p>

      <p>Thank you for choosing our inspection services.</p>
    <% end %>
  </div>

  <div class="footer">
    <p>Best regards,<br>
    <%= @inspector.name %><br>
    <%= @company_name %></p>
    
    <p><em>This is an automated message. Please do not reply directly to this email. For questions or concerns, please contact us at <%= ENV.fetch('MAILER_REPLY_TO', 'support@example.com') %>.</em></p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>